6th (Junior) GCSE Drama Language And Skills Paper 1: 'Skills'
Part 2. Skill Unit 2: 'Playing On Page'
Questions 1-4. Create and perform a scripted scene/piece of dramatic action that represents a dramatic structure (dramatic unit). Select one of the following models (or adapt a model to your choice of scene):
The Breakfast Table;
An Apology for Actors;
The Entertainment.
